{
  "$comment": [
    "The publicpress.co.uk zone, record for record: the source of truth the Hetzner",
    "zone is created from (../dns.ts) and the expectation zonecheck.py compares",
    "every authoritative server against.",
    "",
    "Captured by `zonecheck.py capture` from the registrar's authoritative servers",
    "(raw answers in captures/publicpress.co.uk.ionos-dig.txt), which refuse zone",
    "transfers. A record is only here if its name is in probe_names, so a new name",
    "must be added there before it can be captured or compared. Absent names are",
    "compared too: every probe name that holds no record must be NXDOMAIN at both",
    "providers.",
    "",
    "The apex NS and SOA are absent on purpose: each provider serves its own.",
    "Values are in zone-file presentation form, which is also what the Hetzner",
    "API takes: absolute names end in a dot, TXT is one or more quoted strings of",
    "at most 255 characters each."
  ],
  "zone": "publicpress.co.uk",
